{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"readerLock","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Calling ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"g_rw_lock_reader_lock()"},{"type":"text","text":" while the current thread already"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owns a write lock leads to undefined behaviour. Read locks however"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can be taken recursively, in which case you need to make sure to","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"g_rw_lock_reader_unlock()"},{"text":" the same amount of times.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is implementation-defined how many read locks are allowed to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"held on the same lock simultaneously. If the limit is hit,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"or if a deadlock is detected, a critical warning will be emitted.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/RWLock\/readerLock()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/RWLock","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/RWLock\/RWLockProtocol-Implementations"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Obtain a read lock on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rwLock"},{"text":". If another thread currently holds","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the write lock on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rwLock"},{"text":", the current thread will block until the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"write lock was (held and) released. If another thread does not hold","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the write lock, but is waiting for it, it is implementation defined"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"whether the reader or writer will block. Read locks can be taken","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"recursively.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/glib\/rwlock\/readerlock()"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"readerLock()","modules":[{"name":"GLib"}],"extendedModule":"GLib","externalID":"s:4GLib14RWLockProtocolPAAE10readerLockyyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:4GLib6RWLockC","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"readerLock","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}]},"references":{"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib","title":"GLib","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/glib","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/RWLock":{"title":"RWLock","url":"\/documentation\/glib\/rwlock","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/RWLock","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The GRWLock struct is an opaque data structure to represent a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"reader-writer lock. It is similar to a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Mutex","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" in that it allows","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"multiple threads to coordinate access to a shared resource."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RWLock","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RWLock"}]},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/Mutex":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Mutex"},{"type":"text","text":" struct is an opaque data structure to represent a mutex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(mutual exclusion). It can be used to protect data against shared","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access."}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Mutex","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Mutex","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"Mutex","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Mutex","url":"\/documentation\/glib\/mutex"},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/RWLock/readerLock()":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"readerLock","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"readerLock()","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Obtain a read lock on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rwLock"},{"text":". If another thread currently holds","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the write lock on "},{"code":"rwLock","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the current thread will block until the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"write lock was (held and) released. If another thread does not hold"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the write lock, but is waiting for it, it is implementation defined"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"whether the reader or writer will block. Read locks can be taken"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"recursively."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/RWLock\/readerLock()","url":"\/documentation\/glib\/rwlock\/readerlock()"},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/RWLock/RWLockProtocol-Implementations":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/RWLock\/R